      "text": "Two things are pretty much clear to solve this problem:\n\n1] When we encounter any 0 in order to convert it to one we have to change the three \n  consecutive elements.\n2] We can skip all the one's  ",
      "fontSize": 19.788744588744574,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two things are pretty much clear to solve this problem:\n\n1] When we encounter any 0 in order to convert it to one we have to change the three \n  consecutive elements.\n2] We can skip all the one's  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
